			<div class="pvlRichtext" style="text-align:center"><h2 style="text-align: center;">Pathway of Hope in Oconee County</h2>
<p style="text-align: center;">Working hand in hand with local organizations who are making a difference in Oconee lives is important to us. Pathway of Hope in Oconee County partners with local county agencies who are successfully assisting individuals and families desiring to break their cycle of poverty. Partnering with these agencies allows The Salvation Army of Oconee to make a dramatic impact in the lives of individuals committed to change.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">To learn more about the work of these partnering organizations, visit the links below.</p></div>
